            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">5</td>
            <td>
                Ensure that a duly calibrated Gas leak detector and Oxygen meter
                is available on site &amp; are in proper working condition.
            </td>
            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">6</td>
            <td>
                Ensure appropriate 5 nos. of fire extinguishers (9 Kgs. each) and
                non-sparking tools are available at Site.
            </td>
            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">7</td>
            <td>
                Ensure the fabrication &amp; testing of pipe/valves is completed in
                all respects. <b>Refer COP: Section 051 &amp; 054.</b>
            </td>
            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">8</td>
            <td>
                Ensure all emergency fittings are available on site.
