                the NRO. Also ensure application of clamp as suitable before
                operation of valve.
            </td>
            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">10</td>
            <td>
                Ensure proper earthing of the vent hose during the venting operation.
            </td>
            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">11</td>
            <td>
                Ensure switch off TR unit before hot work on Steel Pipeline.
            </td>
            <td align="center">O&amp;M Engineer</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td align="center">12</td>
            <td>
                Ensure that all personnel involved in hot work are with their
